STATEMENT: >>>
Any valid Unicode string shall survive SET then GET over a real socket.
<<<
VERIFIED_BY: >>>
- ClientTests.AnyUnicodeValue_RoundTripsOverTheWire
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ITS-RL-022
STATUS: Active
