AUTH, SELECT and CLIENT SETNAME shall be pipelined before the first command; no AUTH shall be
sent when no password is configured; and a wrong password shall fail fast without retrying.
<<<
VERIFIED_BY: >>>
- ClientTests.Handshake_AuthSelectAndName_ArePipelinedBeforeFirstCommand
- ClientTests.MissingPassword_GetsNoAuth
- ClientTests.WrongPassword_FailsFastWithoutRetrying
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ITS-RL-026
STATUS: Active
TITLE: TLS
STATEMENT: >>>
The client shall connect over TLS when the server certificate passes the configured validation
and shall reject an untrusted certificate.
<<<
VERIFIED_BY: >>>
- ClientTests.Tls_WithAnOnTheFlyCertificate
- ClientTests.Tls_UntrustedCertificate_IsRejected
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ITS-RL-027
STATUS: Active
